<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-LOKOMOTIV MOSCOW BEAT SAMARA IN RUSSIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LOKOMOTIV MOSCOW BEAT SAMARA IN RUSSIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal result in the Russian Cup on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Lokomotiv Moscow  1  Krylya Sovietov Samara  0</p>
<p>Lokomotiv now meet Dynamo Moscow, who beat Zenit St Petersburg in their semifinal on Tuesday, in the final in Moscow on June 11.</p>
</text>
